---
---

<article class="sharp-border bg-surface-container-lowest group overflow-hidden scroll-reveal">
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row">
    <div class="md:w-1/2 relative h-64 md:h-auto overflow-hidden">
      <img
        alt="Análisis de malware — variantes de ransomware industriales"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0"
        src="/image/macro_shot_of_server_hardware_with_glowing_red_status_lights_cyber_security.png"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-surface-container-lowest via-transparent to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 flex gap-2">
        <span class="bg-primary text-white px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-tighter">FEATURED REPORT</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="md:w-1/2 p-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-on-surface-variant font-mono text-[12px]">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">calendar_today</span>
          OCT 24, 2024
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">bolt</span>
          HIGH SEVERITY
        </span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg group-hover:text-primary transition-colors leading-tight uppercase text-white">
        Análisis de Malware: Nuevas Variantes de Ransomware
      </h2>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm line-clamp-3">
        Aumento del 140% en ataques dirigidos a sistemas PLC industriales. El nuevo motor utiliza técnicas de anti-debugging que evaden sandboxes tradicionales.
      </p>
      <button class="w-fit inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-white bg-primary px-6 py-3 font-bold uppercase text-xs tracking-widest hover:bg-primary/80 transition-all mt-2" type="button">
        LEER REPORTE
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">chevron_right</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>